{"name":"Playmate Pink","hex":"#e9c7d0","fetched":"2026-10-24","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"playmate","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A companion for someone (especially a child) to play with.","A person's lover."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/playmate"},{"term":"pink","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A color reminiscent of pinks, the flowers.","Magenta, the colour evoked by red and blue light when combined."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a colour between red and white; pale red.","Of a fox-hunter's jacket: scarlet."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pink"}],"entries":[{"title":"Playboy Playmate","blocks":[{"text":"A Playmate is a female model featured in the centerfold/gatefold of Playboy magazine as Playmate of the Month (PMOTM). The PMOTM's pictorial includes nude photographs and a centerfold poster, along with a pictorial biography and the \"Playmate Data Sheet\", which lists her birthdate, measurements, turn-ons, and turn-offs. At the end of the year, one of the 12 Playmates of the Month is named Playmate of the Year (PMOTY). Every Playmate of the Month is awarded a prize of US$25,000 and each Playmate of the Year receives an additional prize of US$100,000 plus a car and other discretionary gifts. In addition, Anniversary Playmates are usually chosen to celebrate a milestone year of the magazine. The use of the word \"Playmate\" in a sexual sense did not originate with Playboy and was seen at least as early as 1950 in Vue magazine."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Carmella_DeCesare_calibre68.jpg/330px-Carmella_DeCesare_calibre68.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Playboy_Playmate","wikidata":"Q728711"},{"title":"Pink","blocks":[{"text":"Pink is a pale tint of red or rose, the color of the pink flower. It was first used as a color name in the late 17th century. A combination of pink and white is associated with innocence, whereas a combination of pink and black links to eroticism and seduction."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Pink_sapphire_ring.jpg/330px-Pink_sapphire_ring.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pink","wikidata":"Q429220"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Carmella_DeCesare_calibre68.jpg/500px-Carmella_DeCesare_calibre68.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Carmella_DeCesare_calibre68.jpg/500px-Carmella_DeCesare_calibre68.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"2004 Playmate of the Year Carmella DeCesare (April 2006)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACarmella_DeCesare_calibre68.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Dahm_triplets.jpg/500px-Dahm_triplets.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Dahm_triplets.jpg/500px-Dahm_triplets.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Nicole, Erica and Jaclyn Dahm, the first triplet playmates","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADahm_triplets.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Raquel_Pomplun_2013.JPG/500px-Raquel_Pomplun_2013.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Raquel_Pomplun_2013.JPG/500px-Raquel_Pomplun_2013.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Raquel Pomplun, the first Mexican-American playmate","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARaquel_Pomplun_2013.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org